# covers: 0b E0.1, 0b E1.4, 0b E4.1, 0b E6.1, 0b E6.2, 1a E2.1
# 0b-login-enter-world: dev-token login, character list (a new human when the account has
# none), play ticket, WebSocket with the ticket in the upgrade header, own EntitySpawn, own pawn
# at the spawn tile. `connected` and `in_world` are the gate every later scenario starts with.
#
# Timeouts (R1): gRPC calls have a 5 s deadline (CallTimeoutSeconds); 3x for login and the
# list/create/ticket chain. A first reconnect would add 0.5 s.
nf.Login
nf.WaitFor connected 15
nf.EnterWorld                     # lists characters; creates one on a fresh test:<uuid> account
nf.WaitFor ws_connected 15
nf.WaitFor in_world 15            # own EntitySpawn received and L_TestZone loaded
nf.Expect own_spawns == 1         # exactly one admission: the own EntitySpawn
nf.Expect own_entity_unchanged
nf.Expect own_at 0 0 1            # a new character stands at the zone origin (character Position::default)
nf.WaitFor own_pawn_at 0 0 1 3
nf.Expect rejected == none
nf.Expect target == none
nf.Expect attack_state == idle
nf.Within 45
